# The first install of .spun, built with SELF_REPAIR=1, with no spun.cat:
# get spun, through gui-test.py's proxy (@PORT@) to the test server, is a
# normal get with no repair. y takes the suggested /apps/wifi/spun; o
# overwrites C:/dot/spun. mame-repair.sh checks the commands sent, spun.cat
# and the files after the run.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
autostart .spun -p @PORT@ get spun
autostart PRINT "SPUNREPAIRDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 45
noreset 7.5
key 16 y
key 22 o
snap 15 21 25 30 44
screen 44 Install to C:/apps/wifi/spun?
screen 44 Installed
screen 44 SPUNREPAIRDONE
